# Dantooine, the crystal (kinrath) cave and back (TSL, 604DAN, 601DAN,
# 602DAN): the atmospheric sensors in the rubble by the entrance (Bao-Dur
# on them; no Awareness or Repair to open one), Ahrnell the rock-collecting
# mercenary (apologised to, left with his gland: DSimpson's every way to it
# is dark), Kreia on the cave's memories, a crystal formation disturbed:
# the Matriarch and her hatchlings fought, her remains, the formations and
# the Exile's own crystal (Kreia's talk on it); back to Saedhe (the
# sensors sold for 3000: the surveillance and the light path's refusal are
# asked only of one who opened them) and to Zherron (the kinrath cleared:
# 2000). Starts from the plains' checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @dantooine_plains data/routes/tsl/dantooine_cave.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "The Crystal/Kinrath Cave" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
exit To_604
module 604dan
use cont_sensor      # the rubble: the three sensors
say I'll keep that in mind. # Bao-Dur on them
to tr_cont_cv
talk
say My apologies.    # Ahrnell: no gland asked
say I'm just exploring
say I'll be going now.
use g_merc_pat
talk
to tr_kreia_crystal  # Kreia: the crystals hold the Force, Revan passed here
talk
use cryform_bl@1     # a formation disturbed: the Matriarch and her brood
fight 60
use g_kinrath_mom    # her remains
use cryform_bl@2     # the other formations
use cryform_bl@3
use crystal_cont     # the Exile's own crystal: Kreia's talk on it
talk
exit To_601
module 601dan
say Actually, I've found three of them. # Saedhe: the sensors sold
say Here you go - I'll take the credits.
use npc_saedhe
talk
exit To_602
module 602dan
to npc_berun         # BLOCKER: by Berun's desk, as dantooine_khoonda says
say I cleared out the kinrath cave. # Zherron's reward
use npc_zherron
talk
to npc_berun         # BLOCKER: back by Berun's desk (dantooine_khoonda)
exit To_601
module 601dan
save dantooine_rewards
